[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6310.709, "timestamp": "01:45:10", "text": "哇，太美了。 等等，那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6314.87, "timestamp": "01:45:14", "text": "边缘食肉计划。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6316.709, "timestamp": "01:45:16", "text": "好的，接下来我要讲一个夸张的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6319.59, "timestamp": "01:45:19", "text": "故事。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6321.75, "timestamp": "01:45:21", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6324.07, "timestamp": "01:45:24", "text": "你知道，自从我开始使用 Melt 之后，我就不再"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6326.87, "timestamp": "01:45:26", "text": "使用 OBS 了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6333.51, "timestamp": "01:45:33", "text": "如果我使用 HTML 之类的东西，要把这个东西弹出来，然后把歌曲里的内容添加进去，真是太难了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6338.149, "timestamp": "01:45:38", "text": "。 真是太麻烦了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6340.47, "timestamp": "01:45:40", "text": "我觉得我必须想办法实现这个自动化，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6348.149, "timestamp": "01:45:48", "text": "用 HTML 叠加层那样，对吧？ 我觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6352.229, "timestamp": "01:45:52", "text": "以后得把那件事自动化才行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6354.55, "timestamp": "01:45:54", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6357.669, "timestamp": "01:45:57", "text": "哦，好痛。 我知道。"}]